52
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:34,500
かくれんぼたまには
Hide-and-seek every now and then

53
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:36,000
大事だと思う
I think is important.

54
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:37,800
自分を守る念力
The psychic power to protect myself

55
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,500
ばかり強くなるけど
just keeps getting stronger, but...

56
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:41,200
人類なんだしー
we're human after all,

57
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:43,000
自由自在のはずが
we should be free to do as we please,

58
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,800
お利口な素振りで
but acting like good kids,

59
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,500
味のしない
it's tasteless.

60
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:47,800
心配せんよ
Don't worry,

61
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,800
動悸が加速する
