00:45:51,112 --> 00:45:53,752
弱音と本音で泣いたりと
Crying with complaints and true feelings,

759
00:45:53,752 --> 00:45:56,652
諦めかけた分かれ道 “ルート” も
Even the parting routes we almost gave up on—

760
00:45:56,772 --> 00:46:01,492
振り返って笑うようにずっとなれたんだよ
Looking back, I've grown so much stronger.

761
00:46:02,212 --> 00:46:07,012
それでは重大告知、どうぞ！
And now, for the major announcement—here it is!

762
00:46:14,612 --> 00:46:21,112
自分らしさってなんだろう？
What does being myself mean?

763
00:46:25,112 --> 00:46:30,112
上手く言えなかったわたしへ
To the me who couldn't say it well,

764
00:46:31,612 --> 00:46:34,612
ひとりで探してきた
I searched for it alone,

765
00:46:35,612 --> 00:46:38,612
仲間と見つけてきた
Found it together with my friends,

766
00:46:39,112 --> 00:46:41,912
キミが見つけてくれた
And you found it for me.

767
00:46:42,112 --> 00:46:44,912
さくらみこになるまでの物語
The story until I became Sakura Miko.

768
00:46:45,112 --> 00:46:50,612
さくらみこ 1st Album 発売決定！！
Sakura Miko 1st Album Release Confirmed!!

769
00:46:53,112 --> 00:46:56,112
あったけの花束を
With a warm bouquet of flowers,

770
00:47:18,112 --> 00:47:22,112
思うままに歌ったこの歌が あなたの芽吹きになりますように。
May this song I sang as I pleased become a sprout for you.

771
00:47:25,112 --> 00:47:27,612
